          code: "expected = [1.0, -2.0, -1.0, 2.0, -1.5, 0.5, 2.5, -0.5]\ngot = dense(x, W1, b1)\nassert all(abs(g - e) < 1e-9 for g, e in zip(got, expected)), 'expected %r | actual: %r' % (expected, got)",
