        { ar: 'قيم تحقق: dense(x, W1, b1) = [1.0, -2.0, -1.0, 2.0, -1.5, 0.5, 2.5, -0.5]، وforward(x) = -5.0، وforward([0.5, 0.5]) = -0.25.', en: 'Sanity values: dense(x, W1, b1) = [1.0, -2.0, -1.0, 2.0, -1.5, 0.5, 2.5, -0.5], forward(x) = -5.0, forward([0.5, 0.5]) = -0.25.' },
